OL,3,GNEWSATrees down and homes left without
OL,4,Apower after storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrees were uprooted and damage was
OL,7,Fcaused as Storm Boelo made its way
OL,8,Facross the region at the weekend,
OL,9,Fdamaging cars, closing tourist
OL,10,Fattractions and leaving homes without
OL,11,Fpower.
OL,13,FOne motorist had a close miss in
OL,14,FBarton-upon-Humber when a tree was
OL,15,Fuprooted and fell on his car bonnet
OL,16,Fwhile he was driving on Toft Road on
OL,17,FSunday morning.
OL,19,FHumberside Police said a man was taken
OL,20,Fto hospital for checks but was not
OL,21,Finjured in the incident.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
