OL,3,GNEWSATrees down and homes left without
OL,4,Apower after storm
OL,5,
OL,6,FLouis Taylor, whose own car was written
OL,7,Foff in the same incident, said "another
OL,8,Ftwo feet [and] he'd have been killed".
